rill and excitement of \u201cNinja Warrior\u201d come alive in VR!\nUse every bit of your strength, balance, and reflexes to conquer intense obstacle courses through full-body motion."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "\u6a2a\u9577\u30ab\u30cf\u3099\u30fc_2560\u00d71440px.png", "id": "4206557512967114", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619098_4206557516300447_943281957663249977_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GejXusfIIxoQ7kNvwGKYGCG&_nc_oc=Adpn355wpETA7riQp3d_LXSGNPxoLZtad3TxgQowYbbZRwkCuioSfz1S07jVsK3A45Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRxvNnZwuYe_4qASK2SXCipjOHiWmQMdk6BBXxr0CPTCg&oe=6B05A72F"}, {"file_name": "\u30d2\u30fc\u30ed\u30fc\u30ab\u30cf\u3099\u30fc_3000\u00d7900px.png", "id": "2975615619303809", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619774_2975615622637142_1331376706207959328_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wLJgQfs1CRMQ7kNvwFzLqpx&_nc_oc=Adood0ceJSmJvLUATn1YNtENzNywg2EX0X1Mn5fr-duobvAdbsoHtT09QSqVqb_qnN0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSac9HYdoZgf0l8t59TQO5nYAzbqMmaXy-YJ44Yb8v9ww&oe=6B05B91A"}, {"file_name": "\u7e26\u9577\u306e\u30ab\u30cf\u3099\u30fc_1008\u00d71440px.png", "id": "1459347908497843", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619096_1459347911831176_5240984296618367253_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Itg0ZxIN6AgQ7kNvwEiikPA&_nc_oc=AdrHG2Py05LnxHVQJHr-2Jxnd-iX7Ae5QX6Hrk9uejrx604aYAhUCmwdrwcMSR9TOtw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS5oAMd9oFNO2JonxwSQlqHT_Y7KKkYappwkqFPHJ4sQw&oe=6B05D67C"}, {"file_name": "\u30a2\u30a4\u30b3\u30f3_512\u00d7512px.png", "id": "1182588407080721", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scon